WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:39.430
<i>A crisis was closing in on Tokyo.</i>

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:45.890
<i>And the Mega Digimon,
Nidhoggmon, appeared.</i>

00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:51.980
<i>That's when Omegamon made a reappearance</i>

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:54.860
<i>and led the Chosen Ones to victory.</i>

00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:05.910
<i>However, Sora and the others was swallowed
by a sudden storm and vanished!</i>

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:18.070
Nidhoggmon...

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:22.110
That birth and death
shall become a foundation.

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:27.770
The path to reach evolution's end
will soon see moments of success.

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:35.190
Let it ring...
The voices of the outer world.

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:42.930
And now, the other unexpected gift
that was brought upon by chance...

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:45.120
Bring it before me.

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:06.310
Koshiro, can you hear me? Koshiro!

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:11.560
Sora, Mimi-chan, Joe Senpai!
If you can hear me, please respond!

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.560
Where are you?!

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:17.070
They disappeared...

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:23.550
Hello? This is Taichi!

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:24.570
Hello?

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:28.120
<i>This is Koshiro.</i>

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:30.600
It's Koshiro!

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:32.480
Koshiro! Koshiro!

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.580
<i>Taichi-san! This is Koshiro!</i>

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:37.230
You were alive!

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:38.420
And everyone else?

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:42.740
<i>Sora-san, Mimi-san,
and Joe-san are with me.</i>

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:44.310
<i>What about Yamato-san?</i>

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:46.240
Yamato's right here.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.430
So are Agumon and Gabumon.

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:51.100
Koshiro, where are you right now?

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:54.940
The thing is... we...

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:02.490
We came back.

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:08.330
To the real Tokyo.

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:12.640
HOWL, JYUOKEN

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:14.000
What?!

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:15.500
Say what?!

00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:20.940
Taichi-san!

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:25.080
Tentomon, Piyomon, Palmon,
and Gomamon are all missing.

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:26.950
Are they over there?

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.680
<i>They're not here either!</i>

00:04:29.390 --> 00:04:30.560
No way...

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:34.810
<i>What on earth is going on?</i>

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:37.990
<i>Anyhow, I'll look into this.</i>

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:40.420
Yeah, please, Koshiro.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.650
<i>Taichi-san, what about all of you?</i>

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:44.450
We...

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:49.280
I think we definitely need
to go see the Holy Digimon.

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:53.040
So, just like before,
we're gonna follow the route.

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:54.500
Straight ahead!

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:56.290
<i>Okay!</i>

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:04.360
<i>The mysterious countdown disappeared
as the city's power returned.</i>

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:04.300
THE POWER RETURNS
WHAT IS THE MYSTERIOUS COUNTDOWN?

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:09.070
<i>However, the effects
of the prolonged power failure remains</i>

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:08.930
CHAOS CONTINUES
WHAT HAPPENED TO THE METROPOLITAN AREA?

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:10.760
<i>and confusion continues.</i>

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:13.830
No one's noticed anything.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:17.830
We've really come back, huh?

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:20.710
Yes, it isn't fake this time.

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:23.690
This is our real world.

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:27.570
Where were you, Senpai?

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:29.840
The police box there!

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:33.890
I said that Tokyo was in big trouble
and this and that happened!

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:36.980
I reported it all,
as a responsible citizen!

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:37.980
What?

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:40.560
But they won't take me seriously!

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:43.400
They told me to just go home!

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:46.680
Even if you tell the truth,
they won't believe you.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:51.100
<i>"I feel another disaster coming."
"Fake news is everywhere."</i>

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:50.430
There's false rumors
all over the internet.

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:53.370
What should we do now?

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:56.790
We're going to have to manage
by ourselves for now.

00:05:56.790 --> 00:06:00.150
We must find where Tentomon
and the others are first.

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:02.270
Oh!

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:05.990
Hikari-chan! Taichi's mom!

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:08.860
Ah, Sora-chan!

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:12.030
What are you doing here?

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:15.180
What? Umm, well...

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:18.770
Wasn't it just a disaster?
The power was out for so long!

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.520
And all that traffic!

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:24.770
Oh! This is perfect.
I'll go get the car right now.

00:06:24.770 --> 00:06:26.880
Watch Hikari and this one for me!

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:35.810
Let's get moving!

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:41.250
The only clue we have right now
is the direction Orgemon showed us.

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:42.460
That's true.

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:43.710
Let's set out!

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:44.820
Let's go!

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:49.320
Look!

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:02.210
VALVEMON

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:15.470
Digimon and humans...

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:20.230
So they're the so-called "Chosen Ones."

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:32.880
Oh, no!

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:33.990
Run!

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:40.250
Behind that building!

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:53.360
We weren't told
what to do with these ones.

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:55.140
Eliminate them!

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:41.140
SPADAMON

00:08:41.470 --> 00:08:43.390
FALCOMON

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:46.150
Are you guys okay?

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:48.000
Y-Yeah...

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:48.880
Get on.

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:49.800
Huh?

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:53.280
My name is Leomon.

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:54.400
LEOMON

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:56.410
Leomon...

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:59.410
We'll withdraw for now.

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:20.910
Thank you!

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:23.520
On top of saving us,
you're even sharing your food.

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:28.270
You two are the human children
that Neamon was speaking of, right?

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:35.780
Is Neamon...

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:37.550
They're all safe.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:41.620
They've been taken into our troops' care
and are at the refugee camp now.

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:43.620
I see.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:49.330
The anomalies and threats that endanger
this Cloud Continent right now...

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:52.160
At the root of it all is a menace...

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:56.760
One that lures in evil
and give them power...

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:02.100
This existence is called "Devimon."

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:04.060
Devimon?

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:06.770
Could it be...

00:10:11.730 --> 00:10:12.860
Devimon...

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:15.780
We are fighting against them.

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:20.050
What about
that big one you were attacking?

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:21.070
Ah...

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:23.120
<i>That Valvemon.</i>

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:27.100
<i>The crowd leading
the Large Transporter Digimon you saw</i>

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:29.830
<i>is also in contact with Devimon.</i>

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:36.340
<i>"They were searching this area
for something and they found it."</i>

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:41.720
That's what my comrades who were
tracing them reported a short while ago.

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:44.560
Based on the communication
we tapped into...

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:48.230
seems like it's related
to the Holy Digimon.

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:50.230
The Holy Digimon!

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:51.690
What?!

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:55.040
We don't know what it is,

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:58.860
but since Devimon wants it,
we had to get to it.

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:03.930
So we launched a surprise attack
in order to steal it.

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:07.010
Then because you saved us...

00:11:07.010 --> 00:11:10.290
Don't worry,
we'll launch another attack soon.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:13.940
Leomon.

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:14.980
Hm?

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:17.480
Let us come along too.

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:21.110
If their cargo is actually related
to the Holy Digimon,

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:22.970
we can't let it slide by.

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:28.810
We traveled all this way
to see the Holy Digimon!

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:32.810
It'll be dangerous.
Are you prepared for it?

00:11:33.230 --> 00:11:34.210
Of course!

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.320
Yeah!

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:38.570
Prepared? I'm always ready.

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:47.240
I understand.

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:48.540
Very well.

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:54.860
Let's go.

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:55.960
Yeah!

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:14.690
There!

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:21.590
What's the plan?

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:27.590
If we break in and make a ruckus,
they'll tighten the cargo's security.

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:29.200
That's where we look.

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:30.940
Got it!

00:12:30.940 --> 00:12:32.520
Here we go!

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:33.850
Whoa!

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:53.980
Let's go!

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:59.820
We'll head for the bottom first.

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:05.240
Gabumon!

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:25.800
Gabumon Evolution!

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:40.610
Garurumon!

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:43.040
Agumon!

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:43.920
Yeah!

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:45.550
Okay!

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:47.430
Here we go!

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:51.010
Baby Flame!

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:53.160
Fox Fire!

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:02.650
The Chosen Ones.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:03.670
Huh?

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:08.680
It was a name only heard
in ancient legends,

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:12.260
but to think there'd be a day
I'd come to meet them.

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:16.350
An evolution caused by the bond
between human and Digimon...

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:22.690
Is the Digital World's destiny about
to go through a drastic change now?

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:32.410
Leave the back to me!

00:14:32.740 --> 00:14:33.790
Okay!

00:14:40.210 --> 00:14:42.170
Leomon, huh...

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:45.710
Your target must be that cargo.

00:14:46.380 --> 00:14:47.920
If that's the case...

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:04.080
There's lots of them!

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:06.390
So this is the center of security.

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:07.440
No...

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:15.870
It's too easy.

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:20.830
Looks like this is only a storage.

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:22.500
It's further down!

00:15:30.930 --> 00:15:34.930
I've been waiting,
Leomon, the Jyuoken wielder!

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:38.310
Minotaurmon.

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:40.020
MINOTAURMON

00:15:40.430 --> 00:15:43.020
So you're the head of this transport unit.

00:15:45.190 --> 00:15:46.860
Chosen Ones.

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:52.930
The cargo is probably
inside that container in the center.

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:57.120
I'll keep Minotaurmon busy.
That'll be your chance.

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:04.960
Chosen Ones,
I have a playmate prepared for you.

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:07.040
Bullmon!

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:09.800
BULLMON

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:13.380
Agumon!

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:34.260
Agumon Evolution!

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:48.790
Greymon!

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:12.360
The fight has already started!

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:16.740
Then I'll just quickly knock you out cold!

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:22.510
I'll leave Bullmon to you!

00:17:22.510 --> 00:17:23.540
Okay!

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:24.770
Garurumon!

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:33.710
Garurumon!

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:43.430
By turning to the dark side,
what is it that you desire?!

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:47.370
Devimon...

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:49.900
The power Devimon's trying to create.

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:56.650
It'll change everything about us Digimon,
no, the entire Digital World!

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:03.490
Darkside Quake!

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:15.800
Leomon!

00:18:17.130 --> 00:18:18.180
Taichi!

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:20.850
Garurumon!

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:30.330
Yamato!

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.440
Over here! Think you can catch up?

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:45.040
Yamato!

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:13.830
Let's go, Greymon!

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:14.690
Yeah!

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:26.410
Mega Flame!

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:35.590
Yes!

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:40.590
It's about time to end this as well.

00:19:43.090 --> 00:19:46.430
Let us finish this... with our fists!

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:49.490
Very well.

00:19:49.490 --> 00:19:51.950
The fabled Jyuoken.

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:55.440
Let's see if it can beat my iron arm!

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:01.590
Darkside Quake!

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:04.090
Jyuoken!

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:13.710
Darkside...

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:20.780
Shin Jyuoken!

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:33.810
I've got more than one fist.

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:38.730
A new power...

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:42.700
An era of new evolution is approaching.

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:49.080
At your level,
none of you will overcome what's coming!

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:58.590
Something related
to the Holy Digimon, huh.

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:01.800
Now, let's have a look at the cargo.

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:21.690
Takeru!

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:45.470
<i>Why do these held hands</i>

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:45.470
<i>naze ima kono te to te nigitte</i>

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:48.140
<i>And the warmth exchanged</i>

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:48.140
<i>tashikameta taion wo</i>

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:50.600
<i>Make me reminisce now</i>

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:50.600
<i>natsukashiku omou noka</i>

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:56.190
<i>Why an abyss dancing with endless rain</i>

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:56.190
<i>naze samidare no susabu shinen</i>

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:58.690
<i>The gaze of that smile</i>

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:58.690
<i>hohoenda sono shisen ni</i>

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:00.060
<i>Makes me want to cry</i>

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:00.060
<i>nakitaku naru</i>

00:22:00.230 --> 00:22:02.980
<i>So call me with that voice</i>

00:22:00.230 --> 00:22:02.980
<i>sono koe de boku wo yonde kure</i>

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:05.150
<i>This weakness I cannot tell others</i>

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:05.150
<i>dare ni ienu kono yowasa ga</i>

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.240
<i>I realize is my pillar to stand firm</i>

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.240
<i>tsuyoku tatsu tame no jiku dato omoishiru</i>

00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:10.530
<i>Difference is what makes me adore you</i>

00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:10.530
<i>chigau kara itooshiku naru</i>

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:13.490
<i>I just want to understand you and me</i>

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:13.490
<i>tada wakaritai kimi to boku wo</i>

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:15.700
<i>Scars grow the more we live</i>

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:15.700
<i>ikiru hodo kizu ga fuete iku</i>

00:22:15.870 --> 00:22:18.960
<i>But still we seek the reasons for us</i>

00:22:15.870 --> 00:22:18.960
<i>sore demo sagashiteiru bokura no wake wo</i>

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>Overlaying them makes us beautiful</i>

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:21.210
<i>kasanete wa utsukushiku naru</i>

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:25.130
<i>I want to know now, I want to cry out</i>

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:25.130
<i>ima wakaritai sakebi dashitai</i>

00:22:31.350 --> 00:22:33.010
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.160 --> 00:22:35.410
<i>Ikkakumon.</i>

00:22:35.410 --> 00:22:37.490
<i>This Digimon evolves from Gomamon.</i>

00:22:35.520 --> 00:22:37.490
LEVEL: CHAMPION

00:22:37.490 --> 00:22:40.410
TYPE: SEA ANIMAL

00:22:37.490 --> 00:22:41.330
<i>The Harpoon Vulcan attack's horn
can regenerate infinitely.</i>

00:22:40.410 --> 00:22:43.270
SPECIAL MOVE: HARPOON VULCAN

00:22:41.330 --> 00:22:43.270
<i>Consecutive shots can be fired too.</i>

00:22:43.570 --> 00:22:45.460
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:49.340
<i>The red claws can emit high heat
at Ikkakumon's will,</i>

00:22:49.340 --> 00:22:51.630
<i>but can the temperature be adjusted?</i>

00:22:51.630 --> 00:22:55.040
<i>If so, can my bento box
be warmed up with them?</i>

00:22:57.960 --> 00:23:00.370
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.960 --> 00:23:04.690
<i>Yamato risks his life to save Takeru.</i>

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:08.070
<i>And the Holy Digimon makes
an appearance at last.</i>

00:23:08.070 --> 00:23:11.530
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Seventh One Awakens"</i>

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:14.220
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
